OpenConche @PROJECT_VERSION@
============================

An open source, modern, cross-platform engine for Chocolatier, Chocolatier 2:
Secret Ingredients and Chocolatier 3: Decadence by Design, running the games
natively on current systems.

The games' art is 800x600 and is still scaled up, but the engine renders at your
screen's native resolution, so text stays sharp at any window size and in
fullscreen.

OpenConche is only the engine: it runs the games' own shipped scripts and assets,
and none of them are included here. You need your own installed copy of a game.

Running
-------
@CHOCO_DIST_RUN@

Started without arguments, the engine looks for installed games and otherwise
shows a launcher where you point it at a game folder: the Windows game's
"assets" folder, or the Mac game's Contents/Resources/assets. The choice is
remembered. --help lists every option.

Settings and saves
------------------
Kept per game in your user folder (Application Support on macOS, %APPDATA% on
Windows, $XDG_DATA_HOME on Linux). The original game's prefs.dat can be
imported from a copy: see --help, --import-prefs.

